tch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">私は、最近人狼をしています</span><span class=\"s8\">🐺</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-05-20/33897_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6982.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">狼になってみました。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">ですが、追放しないでください</span><span class=\"s8\">🙂</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">この前役職が[騎士]の時に[村人]を守れたんです。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">すごいにやけちゃいました笑</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">[てるてる]という[人狼]でも[村人]でもない役職も担当したのですが、</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">松尾美佑ちゃん（乃木坂</span><span class=\"s5\">46</span><span class=\"s6\">さん）が、ぱるぱるてるてるって言っていて当てられていたのでそこでもにやついてしまいました。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">私は弱いのかもしれません。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">しかし、顔を見ずにしていたのでセーフでした</span><span class=\"s8\">😁</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">今日から</span><span class=\"s5\">1</span><span class=\"s6\">問ずつ皆さんに山口クイズを出したいと思います</span><span class=\"s5\">(^</span><span class=\"s6\">ワ</span><span class=\"s5\">^</span><span class=\"s6\">＝</span><span class=\"s5\">)</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">(</span><span class=\"s6\">知ってどうなるってものもあるかもしれませんがやってみて下さい</span><span class=\"s8\">😊</span><span class=\"s5\">)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">最初からすごく難しいのいきます</span><span class=\"s8\">🙋</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">（ｼﾞｬｰｼﾞｬﾝ</span><span class=\"s8\">🎶</span><span class=\"s6\">）</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s8\">🐶</span><span class=\"s6\">私の小さい頃の夢はなんでしょう！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">制限時間は</span><span class=\"s5\">3</span><span class=\"s6\">日で〜す</span><span class=\"s8\">🤗</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\">そういえばこの前久しぶりに夢を見たんです！</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">夢にある方が出てきて幸せでした</span><span class=\"s5\">(*</span><span class=\"s9\">ˊ</span><span class=\"s10\" style=\"font-family: NotoSansYi-Regular;\">꒳</span><span class=\"s9\">ˋ</span><span class=\"s5\">*)</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">恥ずかしいので名前は</span><span class=\"s8\">🙊</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">皆さんと現実で会えるまで夢で会ってみたいですね</span><span class=\"s5\">(^^)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">明日は、たかはしです</span><span class=\"s8\">🌈</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">名字呼び捨て真似してみました。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">下の名前で呼び捨ては照れるけど名字なら呼べます</span><span class=\"s5\">(&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s6\">・</span><span class=\"s5\">∇</span><span class=\"s6\">・</span><span class=\"s5\">)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございました。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">では、またね</span><span class=\"s8\">🐷</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">山口陽世でした</span><span class=\"s8\">👋🏻</span></p></div>\n                    ",
